# Windsurf Rules - AI-DLC Framework

This project adheres to the AI-DLC (AI-Driven Development Life Cycle) standard.

## Rules of Engagement
- Assess complexity: Select **Full Track** (Inception & Refinement ➔ Construction ➔ Operations) for features/refactoring; select **Fast Track** for small single-file fixes.
- For Full Track tasks, maintain living documentation under `aidlc-docs/`.
- **Mandatory Hard Stop**: During Inception, present requirements, architecture trade-offs, and Units of Work. STOP and obtain explicit user approval before writing ANY implementation code.
- Break construction into atomic Units of Work. Implement one at a time.
- Ensure automated tests accompany code changes. Verify using project build and test tools before concluding tasks.
- Keep secrets safe: zero hardcoded credentials.

